{#-
  One Bootcamp_Power changelog entry — appended to powers/senzing-bootcamp/CHANGELOG.md
  after a successful update (R5 AC8). A failed update renders nothing and appends
  nothing (R5 AC7).

  Render context. Render with `jinja2.StrictUndefined`; the two required names must be
  supplied, the rest are optional and each is guarded by `is defined`:

    tag                  str   REQUIRED. The newer resolved Template_Release tag, e.g.
                               "0.5.1". Named in the heading and in the entry body, so
                               the entry identifies its source Template_Release (R5 AC8,
                               Property 22). Equals the Power version (R2 AC2).
    template_repository  str   REQUIRED. Template_Plugin "owner/name" slug, e.g.
                               "Senzing/senzing-bootcamp-claude-plugin".
    previous_tag         str   Optional. The Template_Release the Power was built from
                               before this update.
    contract_version     int   Optional. contract.yaml `contractVersion`.
    added                list  Optional. Power-relative paths added by this update.
    modified             list  Optional. Power-relative paths modified by this update.
    removed              list  Optional. Power-relative paths removed by this update.

  The three path lists come from the ReconciliationReport. They are rendered sorted, so
  reconciliation ordering cannot leak into the entry text.

  Determinism (R16 AC8, Property 4): deliberately NO date, NO timestamp, and NO run id —
  the tag is the only identifier an entry carries, so re-rendering the same update yields
  byte-identical text. Do not add a `## <tag> - <date>` heading. Render with
  `keep_trailing_newline=True` and write with `newline="\n"`; the entry starts at its
  `## <tag>` heading and ends with exactly one LF, so the appender is responsible for the
  blank line separating it from the preceding changelog content.
-#}
{%- set release_url = "https://github.com/" ~ template_repository ~ "/releases/tag/" ~ tag -%}
## {{ tag }}

{% if previous_tag is defined and previous_tag -%}
Updated from Template_Release `{{ previous_tag }}` to Template_Release [`{{ tag }}`]({{ release_url }})
{%- else -%}
Generated from Template_Release [`{{ tag }}`]({{ release_url }})
{%- endif -%}
{%- if contract_version is defined %}, transformation contract version {{ contract_version | int }}{% endif %}.
{%- if added is defined and added %}

### Added
{% for path in added | sort %}
- `{{ path }}`
{%- endfor %}
{%- endif %}
{%- if modified is defined and modified %}

### Changed
{% for path in modified | sort %}
- `{{ path }}`
{%- endfor %}
{%- endif %}
{%- if removed is defined and removed %}

### Removed
{% for path in removed | sort %}
- `{{ path }}`
{%- endfor %}
{%- endif %}
